The software contains hard-coaded numerical data of Riemann zeta function generated by using a fortran code developed by sikino.
  (c)sikino,https://slpr.sakura.ne.jp/qp/,(2016)
  The data were rounded to reduce the file size. Therefore, the accuracy is worse than sikino's original data.


